# Pairs with StaleEpochNeverAppends. The shard's epoch check dropped: a stale
# duplicate keeps appending after a newer activation claimed. Moved from the
# design's NoTrimPastAckedNoEpochCheck, whose consequence (a live advance past the
# stale entries) the core module owns.
MODULE: StaleEpochNeverAppendsNoEpochCheck
TARGET: StaleEpochNeverAppends
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the WAL shard accepts an append from an epoch below its entry
PERTURBS: OwnAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ AppendAdmits(a)
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the shard does not check the epoch against its entry.
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- END
